# Local dev secrets — a per-developer HuggingFace token for downloading gated
# models without re-pasting it into Settings after every reinstall. THIS REPO
# IS PUBLIC: the real file must never be committed. Only `dev_secrets.dart` is
# ignored; the committed `dev_secrets.example.dart` is the template to copy.
# Read only in debug builds (see huggingFaceTokenProvider).
/lib/dev/dev_secrets.dart
